<svg class="diagram-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 510" role="img" aria-labelledby="bdl25densitypropagation-title bdl25densitypropagation-desc" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <title id="bdl25densitypropagation-title">A Gaussian density propagated through a nonlinear mapping</title>
  <desc id="bdl25densitypropagation-desc">Panel a shows the likelihood p(y given x) for y equal to a nonlinear function of x plus Gaussian noise, as a surface over x and y, with the slice at a fixed x highlighted. Panel b shows the unnormalized posterior p(y given x) times p(x), with the slice at a fixed y highlighted and the Gaussian p(x) drawn along the back. Panel c shows the unimodal Gaussian p(x) on the left and, after the nonlinear mapping, the multimodal p(y = y-hat given x) p(x) on the right, with three peaks.</desc>
